msgstr "Pipeline wurde mit {} Zeilen Blueprint UI Markup entwickelt."

#: src/splashes.rs:64
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "There are {} different splash texts which can be displayed here."
msgstr "Hier können {} verschiedene Splash-Texte angezeigt werden."

#. Translators: "Splash" as in the splash text from Minecraft: https://minecraft.wiki/w/Splash.
#: src/splashes.rs:74
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"In expectation, you will need to reload {} times to have seen all splash "
"texts at least once."
msgstr ""
"Im Durchschnitt sind {} Neuladungen nötig, um alle Splash-Texte mindestens "
"einmal zu sehen."

#: src/splashes.rs:80
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline is translated in {languages} different languages by {translators} "
"translators"
msgstr ""
"Pipeline wird von {translators} Übersetzern in {languages} verschiedene "
"Sprachen übersetzt"

#: src/splashes.rs:94
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can help translate Pipeline using <a href=\"https://hosted.weblate.org/"
"engage/schmiddi-on-mobile/\">Weblate</a>."
msgstr ""
"Helfe dabei Pipeline zu übersetzen auf <a href=\"https://hosted.weblate.org/"
"engage/schmiddi-on-mobile/\">Weblate</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:100
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The source code of Pipeline is hosted on <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/"
"schmiddi-on-mobile/pipeline\">GitLab</a>."
msgstr ""
"Der Quellcode von Pipeline wird gehostet auf <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/"
"schmiddi-on-mobile/pipeline\">GitLab</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:106
#, c-format
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We have a <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix "
"room</a> where you can come and talk with us."
msgstr ""
"Wir haben einen <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/"
"%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix-Raum</a>, wo du mit uns sprechen kannst."

#: src/splashes.rs:112
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline has a <a href=\"https://mobile.schmidhuberj.de/pipeline\">website</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline hat eine <a href=\"https://mobile.schmidhuberj.de/"
"pipeline\">Webseite</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:118
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can get Pipeline on <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathub</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline ist auf <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathub</a> erhältlich."

#: src/splashes.rs:124
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/clapper\">Clapper</a> as the "
"video player."
msgstr ""
"Als Videoplayer nutzen wir <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/"
"clapper\">Clapper</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:130
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">rustypipe</a> "
"and <a href=\"https://piped.video/\">Piped</a> to get data from YouTube."
msgstr ""
"Wir verwenden <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">"
"rustypipe</a> und <a href=\"https://piped.video/\">Piped </a> um Daten von "
"YouTube abzurufen."

#: src/splashes.rs:136
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The creator of Pipeline has also built other applications, like <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."
msgstr ""
"Der Ersteller von Pipeline hat auch andere Anwendungen erstellt, wie z.B. <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> und <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:142
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"When using Piped to fetch data, Pipeline will be able to fetch your "
"subscriptions faster with more public Piped instances. So consider <a "
"href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">hosting Piped</a> and "
"making it available for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie Piped zum Abrufen von Daten verwenden, kann Pipeline Ihre "
"Abonnements umso schneller abrufen, je mehr öffentliche Piped-Instanzen zur "
"Verfügung stehen. Ziehen Sie daher in Betracht, <a href=\"https://"
"docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">Piped</a> zu hosten und es für alle "
"zugänglich zu machen."

#: src/splashes.rs:148
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"No animals were harmed while making this application. But two cats were "
"petted."
msgstr ""
"Für die Entwicklung dieser Anwendung musste kein Tier leiden. Zwei Katzen "
"durften sich stattdessen über Streicheleinheiten freuen."

#: src/splashes.rs:155
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Add videos to your watch-later list by bringing up their context menu, or "
"directly when watching videos."
msgstr ""
"Füge Videos zur \"Später ansehen\"-Liste über das Kontextmenü oder direkt "
"beim Ansehen hinzu."

#: src/splashes.rs:161
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Seeing something you don't like? You can hide videos from your feed based on "
"the title and uploader of the video."
msgstr ""
"Gibt es etwas, das nicht gefällt? Videos können aus dem Feed ausgeblendet "
"werden, basierend auf Titel und Uploader des Videos."

#: src/splashes.rs:167
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can hide videos you already watched. Enable this by managing your "
"filters."
msgstr ""
"Bereits gesehene Videos können ausgeblendet werden. Diese Funktion kann "
"aktiviert werden, indem man die Filter verwaltet."

#: src/splashes.rs:173
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can quickly toggle on and off filters in the feed from the filter dialog."
msgstr ""
"Filter im Feed können schnell über den Filter-Dialog ein- und ausgeschaltet "
"werden."

#: src/splashes.rs:179
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to keep your subscriptions from YouTube or NewPipe? You can import "
"those into Pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Um deine Abonnements von YouTube oder NewPipe zu behalten, kannst du sie in "
"Pipeline importieren."

#: src/splashes.rs:185
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to bring your own video player instead of the one built-in? You can "
"manage an external video player in the settings and tell Pipeline to use it "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"Es besteht die Möglichkeit, einen externen Videoplayer anstelle des "
"integrierten zu verwenden. Dieser kann in den Einstellungen festgelegt "
"werden, damit Pipeline ihn standardmäßig nutzt."

#: src/splashes.rs:191
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You want to keep a video you watched? You can directly download it from the "
"video page."
msgstr ""
"Möchte man ein angesehenes Video behalten? Dieses kann direkt von der "
"Videoseite heruntergeladen werden."

#: src/splashes.rs:197
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to share a video? You can copy its URL to the clipboard directly from "
"the video page."
msgstr ""
"Soll ein Video geteilt werden? Dessen URL kann direkt von der Videoseite in "
"die Zwischenablage kopiert werden."

#: src/splashes.rs:203
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Are you hosting your own Piped instance? You can tell Pipeline to use it in "
"the settings."
msgstr ""
"Soll eine selbst gehostete Piped-Instanz genutzt werden? Diese lässt sich "
"über die Einstellungen für Pipeline festlegen."

#: src/splashes.rs:210
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Not interested in those splash texts? You can disable them in the settings."
msgstr ""
"Kein Interesse an den Splash-Texten? Diese lassen sich in den Einstellungen "
"deaktivieren."

#: src/splashes.rs:216
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Don't like YouTube anymore? Pipeline also works with <a href=\"https://"
"joinpeertube.org\">PeerTube</a>."
msgstr ""
"Keine Lust mehr auf YouTube? Pipeline funktioniert auch mit <a "
"href=\"https://joinpeertube.org\">PeerTube</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:222
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Searching for something? Pipeline can help you with that and search for "
"channels and videos on YouTube and Peertube."
msgstr ""
"Wird etwas bestimmtes gesucht? Pipeline kann dabei helfen und auf YouTube "
"und Peertube nach Kanälen und Videos suchen."

#: src/splashes.rs:228
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline has four different ways to fetch videos from YouTube. Just to be "
"sure you don't miss any of your precious cat videos."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline hat vier verschiedene Methoden um Videos von Youtube zu laden. Nur "
"um sicherzustellen, dass Sie keine wertvollen Katzenvideos verpassen."

#: src/splashes.rs:243
#, c-format
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Have ideas for further splash text? Tell us on <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/"
"%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ideen für zukünftige Splash-Texte? Teile sie uns mit auf <a href=\"https://"
"matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:249
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Pretty sure {year} will be the year of the Linux desktop."
msgstr "Ziemlich sicher wird {} das Jahr des Linux-Desktops."

#. Translators: A reference to the "I use Arch btw" meme.
#: src/splashes.rs:255
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "I can be used on Arch btw."
msgstr "Ach ja, Ich funktioniere auch auf Arch."

#: src/splashes.rs:260
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Do you want to advertise here? You can't."
msgstr "Sie wollen hier Werbung schalten? Können Sie nicht."

#: src/splashes.rs:277
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "🎉 Pipeline turned {} years old today. Happy Birthday! 🎉"
msgstr "🎉 Pipeline wird heute {} Jahre alt. Alles Gute zum Geburtstag! 🎉"

